 Mides del paper}}K{\footnote \pard\plain \s17\li284\widctlpar\adjustright \f1\fs20\lang1036\cgrid {\cs16\fs16\up6 K}{ configuraci\'f3:tipus de paper;configuraci\'f3;paper;mides del paper}}}{\v !fnote!}{ 
